# Promotion & release automation config: these files drive the develop->main
# promotion pipeline (version bumps, changelog generation, cherry-pick sync-back)
# and the workflow-security allowlist. A careless edit can mis-version a release,
# corrupt the changelog, or silently widen what the "Workflow Security" gate
# ignores -- so every change is routed to lead review. (Automated bot PRs
# from release-please / the sync workflow reach these via bypass actors; required
# status checks still gate the merge.)
